<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Abacus to list &quot;N&quot; shares.</title>
<headline>Abacus to list &quot;N&quot; shares.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment holding company Abacus Technology Holdings Ltd said on Friday it planned to issue eight million non-voting &quot;N&quot; shares to shareholders on the basis of one for every held on May 23.</p>
<p>The shares will be listed on May 26.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
